TEXT 32 32 Left 3 ;#113 Amplifier conduction class from base bias
TEXT 32 96 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c6cmkm3UPUI
TEXT 32 144 Left 2 ;A 2 Vpp signal is coupled to three stepped base biases, changing the conduction angle from A through B to C.
TEXT 32 848 Left 2 !.step param RTOP list 10k 36k 1G
TEXT 32 880 Left 2 !.tran 0 1m 0 200n
TEXT 32 912 Left 2 ;10k: class A; 36k: near class B; 1G: open top resistor approximates class C.
TEXT 32 944 Left 2 ;The video also increases Rc during class C; this comparison holds Rc at 680 ohms.
